{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a general triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/70422100db8de33f8e5e0ab5062c5bb6a5ac969d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ADE$\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> (as shown) lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/b/4ebfeb04023363364c27abf7ad4b73aee668fcfe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{EB}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/7/07735d2b6021b01b9151420c69f0330ca0b544d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{EC}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> are drawn. Which of the following angle relations is true?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fc748152381bf24216aec998b94590521bf3139.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((-8,0)--(-2,0)--(4,0)--(10,0)--(0,10)--cycle,dot); draw((-2,0)--(0,10),dot);draw((4,0)--(0,10),dot); MP(&quot;A&quot;,(-8,0),S);MP(&quot;B&quot;,(-2,0),S);MP(&quot;C&quot;,(4,0),S);MP(&quot;D&quot;,(10,0),S);MP(&quot;E&quot;,(0,10),N); MP(&quot;x&quot;,(-7.9,.4),E);MP(&quot;z&quot;,(-2,.4),W);MP(&quot;m&quot;,(-2,.4),E);MP(&quot;n&quot;,(4,.4),W);MP(&quot;c&quot;,(4,.4),E);MP(&quot;a&quot;,(9.9,.4),W); MP(&quot;y&quot;,(-.2,8.8),SW);MP(&quot;w&quot;,(.1,8.8),S);MP(&quot;b&quot;,(.7,9),SE); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"172\" />\n</p><p><span style=\"color:red\">$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x \\plus{} z \\equal{} a \\plus{} b\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ y \\plus{} z \\equal{} a \\plus{} b\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ m \\plus{} x \\equal{} w \\plus{} n\\qquad \\\\\n\\textbf{(D)}\\ x \\plus{} z \\plus{} n \\equal{} w \\plus{} c \\plus{} m\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ x \\plus{} y \\plus{} n \\equal{} a \\plus{} b \\plus{} m$ (Error compiling LaTeX. Unknown error_msg)</span>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9da7272b06f09b1f8f6b67d6d1b31a3261a4aabd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a